  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Sectoral Study Visit Ministry of Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon&apos;s Ministry of Agriculture is seeking to modernise its institutional framework and drive agricultural innovation, but faces significant structural challenges. This study visit to the Netherlands responds directly to the Lebanese Ministry of Agriculture&#x2019;s interest for knowledge exchange with the Netherlands across the agri-sector. The visit addresses the institutional - and policy gaps, and creates opportunities to get acquainted with Dutch approaches in integrated agricultural production systems, market-oriented systems and trade opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
